province = 65
blurb = "Depicts three pilgrims and a monk walking among the pampas grass on a marshy plain near the Odai (sometimes spelled Otai) station on the Kisokaidō. This location is in the present-day town of Miyota, Nagano prefecture.

One of the pilgrims on the left is holding a baby. The person on the right is a fundraising monk carrying a banner saying \"Construction of the Main Hall\". Such monks would travel the country collecting donations for their temples.

In the background is Mount Hirao, a 1,156-meter-tall dormant volcano overlooking the Saku plains."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
